# Working output from the map tools. These are LOOKING aids -- butted join
# strips, in-game captures at a metre mark, before/after copies kept across a
# re-render -- and they are big: one sweep of mapshot.py is ~50MB of PNG. They
# are regenerated by running the tool again, so they never belong in a repo that
# ships as a phone app.
